Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:04:06.42,HEADA,,0,0,0,,{\r\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\c&H8CDC4A&}▍{\r\fn得意黑}2026 辛辛那提 WTA1000 第二轮
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:04:06.42,HEADB,,0,0,0,,{\r\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\c&H8CDC4A&}高芙 {\r\fnBarlow Condensed SemiBold\c&HFFFFFF&\fs44}2-6 6-4 6-1{\r\fnNoto Sans CJK SC} 萨姆索诺娃 · 赛后场上采访
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.04,0:00:02.36,EN,,0,0,0,,Sealing it in style
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.04,0:00:02.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,这一分收得漂亮
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.36,0:00:06.00,EN,,0,0,0,,and a big celebration
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.36,0:00:06.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,庆祝的动作也很大
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.12,0:00:11.32,EN,,0,0,0,,to match a big comeback from Coco Gauff.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.12,0:00:11.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,配得上这样一场逆转
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.32,0:00:13.72,EN,,0,0,0,,A terrific effort from Liudmila Samsonova
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.32,0:00:13.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,萨姆索诺娃打得非常好
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.72,0:00:20.16,EN,,0,0,0,,who was superb for almost two sets.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.72,0:00:20.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,将近两盘她都压着高芙
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.20,0:00:23.16,EN,,0,0,0,,And Coco Gauff's celebration tells you just
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.20,0:00:23.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,而高芙庆祝的样子就说明了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.16,0:00:27.64,EN,,0,0,0,,how tough that was to come back from.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.16,0:00:27.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,这一场翻回来有多难
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.64,0:00:30.60,EN,,0,0,0,,She gets it done again.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.64,0:00:30.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,她又一次做到了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.60,0:00:41.56,EN,,0,0,0,,We shouldn't be surprised.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.60,0:00:41.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,我们其实不该感到意外
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.56,0:00:44.68,EN,,0,0,0,,You are an absolute warrior.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.56,0:00:44.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,你就是个不折不扣的斗士
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.68,0:00:46.44,EN,,0,0,0,,It's like you just decided you
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.68,0:00:46.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,感觉就是你自己定了主意
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.44,0:00:48.76,EN,,0,0,0,,were not letting that one go.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.44,0:00:48.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,这场球你绝不放手
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.76,0:00:50.04,EN,,0,0,0,,What did you tell yourself,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.76,0:00:50.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,当时你跟自己说了什么
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.04,0:00:51.96,EN,,0,0,0,,especially in that second set?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.04,0:00:51.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,尤其是第二盘那会儿
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.96,0:00:53.16,EN,,0,0,0,,Well, honestly,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.96,0:00:53.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,说实话
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.16,0:00:55.08,EN,,0,0,0,,I was not playing really good at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.16,0:00:55.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,我打得一点都不好
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.08,0:00:56.76,EN,,0,0,0,,I'm sure you guys could see that.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.08,0:00:56.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,你们肯定都看出来了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.76,0:00:59.16,EN,,0,0,0,,So, I was just trying to find my rhythm
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.76,0:00:59.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,所以我就想先把节奏找回来
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.16,0:01:01.40,EN,,0,0,0,,and, you know, God came in clutch
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.16,0:01:01.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,然后老天爷帮了个大忙
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.40,0:01:02.84,EN,,0,0,0,,with a little bit of a rain delay,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.40,0:01:02.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,下了一小会儿雨
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.84,0:01:04.36,EN,,0,0,0,,was able to reset.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.84,0:01:04.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,我得以重新调整
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.36,0:01:05.80,EN,,0,0,0,,But honestly, the support
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.36,0:01:05.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,但说实话
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.80,0:01:07.24,EN,,0,0,0,,that you guys give me, I was like,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.80,0:01:07.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,你们给我的支持 我当时就想
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.24,0:01:09.72,EN,,0,0,0,,I cannot thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.24,0:01:09.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,我真的谢不过来
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.72,0:01:14.36,EN,,0,0,0,,I was like, I mean, I know win or lose,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.72,0:01:14.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,我知道无论输赢
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.36,0:01:16.44,EN,,0,0,0,,you guys have my back, but I just was like,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.36,0:01:16.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,你们都会挺我 但我当时心里想
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.44,0:01:17.72,EN,,0,0,0,,I cannot go out bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.44,0:01:17.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,我不能这么难看地走下场
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.72,0:01:20.12,EN,,0,0,0,,So, I tried to keep winning one point
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.72,0:01:20.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,所以我就想着一分一分来
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.12,0:01:22.52,EN,,0,0,0,,at a time, and then I started to play better.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.12,0:01:22.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,然后我慢慢打得好起来了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.52,0:01:23.64,EN,,0,0,0,,My level started to raise,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.52,0:01:23.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,状态一点点起来了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.64,0:01:25.80,EN,,0,0,0,,and that's tennis, and that's life,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.64,0:01:25.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,网球就是这样 人生也是这样
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.80,0:01:26.84,EN,,0,0,0,,you know, when you're down,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.80,0:01:26.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,落后的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.84,0:01:31.36,EN,,0,0,0,,you got to figure out a way to get out of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.84,0:01:31.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,你得想办法把自己捞出来
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.16,0:01:35.88,EN,,0,0,0,,Not sure if your dad is traveling
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.16,0:01:35.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,不知道今天这个特别的日子
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.88,0:01:37.64,EN,,0,0,0,,with you on this special day.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.88,0:01:37.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,你爸爸有没有跟着你
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.64,0:01:39.16,EN,,0,0,0,,How on earth was he handling
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.64,0:01:39.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,这份紧张兮兮的生日礼物
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.16,0:01:41.96,EN,,0,0,0,,this birthday gift of stress, you know,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.16,0:01:41.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,他到底怎么受得了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.96,0:01:43.72,EN,,0,0,0,,and what message do you have for him?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.96,0:01:43.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,你想对他说点什么
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.72,0:01:45.48,EN,,0,0,0,,You get to say it to the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.72,0:01:45.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,现在全世界都能听见
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.48,0:01:47.08,EN,,0,0,0,,Well, happy birthday, Dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.48,0:01:47.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,生日快乐 爸爸
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.08,0:01:48.60,EN,,0,0,0,,He's not here. He's at home watching
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.08,0:01:48.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,他不在这儿 他在佛罗里达
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.60,0:01:49.40,EN,,0,0,0,,in Florida.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.60,0:01:49.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,在家里看
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.40,0:01:51.64,EN,,0,0,0,,But he's 55 today.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.40,0:01:51.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,他今天五十五岁了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.64,0:01:54.04,EN,,0,0,0,,So, that was another thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.64,0:01:54.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,所以这也是一个原因
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.04,0:01:56.92,EN,,0,0,0,,I was like, I didn't I didn't want to lose
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.04,0:01:56.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,我心里想 我不想
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.92,0:01:57.80,EN,,0,0,0,,on his birthday.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.92,0:01:57.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,在他生日这天输球
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.80,0:02:00.12,EN,,0,0,0,,But yeah, my dad means a lot to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.80,0:02:00.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,我爸爸对我来说意义太重了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.12,0:02:02.04,EN,,0,0,0,,He's the reason why I'm playing
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.12,0:02:02.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,是他让我走上
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.04,0:02:03.72,EN,,0,0,0,,this sport and have so much belief.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.04,0:02:03.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,这条路 也给了我这么多底气
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.72,0:02:06.60,EN,,0,0,0,,Yeah, if it was up to my dad,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.72,0:02:06.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,如果由着我爸爸说
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.60,0:02:08.28,EN,,0,0,0,,he would say I can beat anyone,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.60,0:02:08.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,他会说我谁都能赢
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.28,0:02:10.76,EN,,0,0,0,,even if Carlos Alcaraz is on the other side.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.28,0:02:10.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,哪怕对面站的是阿尔卡拉斯
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.76,0:02:12.84,EN,,0,0,0,,But that really shows the belief
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.76,0:02:12.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,这真的说明了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.84,0:02:15.00,EN,,0,0,0,,that he has in me and I I love him so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.84,0:02:15.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,他有多信我 我太爱他了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.00,0:02:16.76,EN,,0,0,0,,And to all the the dads out there,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.00,0:02:16.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,还有 对所有的爸爸们
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.76,0:02:17.96,EN,,0,0,0,,the tennis dads out there,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.76,0:02:17.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,所有网球爸爸们
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.96,0:02:18.92,EN,,0,0,0,,be good to your girls
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.96,0:02:18.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,对你们的女儿好一点
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.92,0:02:20.84,EN,,0,0,0,,and don't put too much pressure on them
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.92,0:02:20.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,别给她们太大压力
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.84,0:02:22.68,EN,,0,0,0,,because you know,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.84,0:02:22.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,因为你知道
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.68,0:02:24.20,EN,,0,0,0,,the most important thing my dad instilled
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.68,0:02:24.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,我爸爸教给我最重要的一件事
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.20,0:02:25.48,EN,,0,0,0,,in me was just to have fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.20,0:02:25.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,就是打球要开心
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.48,0:02:27.32,EN,,0,0,0,,And the second that you know,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.48,0:02:27.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,哪一天
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.32,0:02:29.00,EN,,0,0,0,,I'm not having fun on the court anymore,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.32,0:02:29.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,我在场上不再觉得开心了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.00,0:02:30.04,EN,,0,0,0,,I'll I'll stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.00,0:02:30.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,我就不打了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.04,0:02:31.88,EN,,0,0,0,,But well, I I think I'll always play tennis,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.04,0:02:31.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,不过我想我这辈子都会打网球
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.88,0:02:35.40,EN,,0,0,0,,but maybe not professionally, obviously.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.88,0:02:35.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,只是可能不再是职业的了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.40,0:02:36.52,EN,,0,0,0,,Coco, you bring that up.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.40,0:02:36.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,高芙 你既然说到这儿
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.52,0:02:39.72,EN,,0,0,0,,I'm so curious to maybe do a little bit
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.52,0:02:39.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,我很想借这个机会
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.72,0:02:41.80,EN,,0,0,0,,of a heart check in front of a few thousand
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.72,0:02:41.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,当着这几千位朋友的面
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.80,0:02:42.44,EN,,0,0,0,,of your friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.80,0:02:42.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,问你一句心里话
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.44,0:02:43.64,EN,,0,0,0,,Miami, you were talking
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.44,0:02:43.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,迈阿密那会儿 你说过
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.64,0:02:45.48,EN,,0,0,0,,about maybe not even wanting to play
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.64,0:02:45.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,你甚至有点不想再打了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.48,0:02:47.56,EN,,0,0,0,,because you weren't enjoying
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.48,0:02:47.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,因为你不再享受
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.56,0:02:49.08,EN,,0,0,0,,being on the court.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.56,0:02:49.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,待在球场上
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.08,0:02:50.36,EN,,0,0,0,,How are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.08,0:02:50.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,你现在怎么样
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.36,0:02:51.80,EN,,0,0,0,,How is tennis for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.36,0:02:51.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,网球对你来说是什么样的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.80,0:02:53.48,EN,,0,0,0,,How's the joy level?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.80,0:02:53.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,开心的程度有多少
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.48,0:02:54.52,EN,,0,0,0,,It's really good.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.48,0:02:54.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,挺好的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.52,0:02:55.80,EN,,0,0,0,,I'm having fun out here.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.52,0:02:55.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,我在场上很快乐
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.80,0:02:56.60,EN,,0,0,0,,Yeah,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.80,0:02:56.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.60,0:02:58.52,EN,,0,0,0,,it was kind of right before Wimbledon
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.60,0:02:58.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,那大概是在温网之前
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.52,0:02:59.56,EN,,0,0,0,,and I lost first round Berlin
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.52,0:02:59.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,我柏林首轮就输了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.56,0:03:00.92,EN,,0,0,0,,and I I called my dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.56,0:03:00.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,然后我给我爸打了电话
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.92,0:03:02.12,EN,,0,0,0,,I was like, I want to stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.92,0:03:02.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,我说 我想不打了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.12,0:03:03.40,EN,,0,0,0,,Like, I can't do this anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.12,0:03:03.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,我说我真的撑不下去了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.40,0:03:05.40,EN,,0,0,0,,And he was like, you know, just go out there
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.40,0:03:05.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,他说 你就明天去球场
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.40,0:03:06.60,EN,,0,0,0,,and just practice tomorrow
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.40,0:03:06.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,照常练一次
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.60,0:03:08.28,EN,,0,0,0,,and I I bet you'll fall in love with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.60,0:03:08.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,我打赌你会重新爱上它
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.28,0:03:10.20,EN,,0,0,0,,And I practiced like two days later.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.28,0:03:10.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,两天之后我就去练了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.20,0:03:11.64,EN,,0,0,0,,And then I had a good run at Wimbledon.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.20,0:03:11.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,然后温网就打出了一段好成绩
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.64,0:03:13.48,EN,,0,0,0,,So, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.64,0:03:13.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,所以你看
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.48,0:03:14.76,EN,,0,0,0,,But the main thing, you know,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.48,0:03:14.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,但最要紧的是
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.76,0:03:16.20,EN,,0,0,0,,I find whenever I focus
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.76,0:03:16.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,我发现只要我把注意力
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.20,0:03:17.80,EN,,0,0,0,,on my joy on the sport, that's
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.20,0:03:17.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,放在打球的快乐上
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.80,0:03:19.96,EN,,0,0,0,,when the results come and and you know,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.80,0:03:19.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,成绩自然就来了 而且
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.96,0:03:21.88,EN,,0,0,0,,the losses make the wins more special.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.96,0:03:21.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,那些失利会让胜利更珍贵
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.88,0:03:23.88,EN,,0,0,0,,So, I'm definitely grateful to be out here
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.88,0:03:23.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,所以我真的很感激能站在这儿
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.88,0:03:25.88,EN,,0,0,0,,and, you know, I just try to give myself
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.88,0:03:25.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,我只是尽量让自己
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.88,0:03:27.72,EN,,0,0,0,,the best mentality out there on the court.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.88,0:03:27.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,带着最好的心态上场
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.72,0:03:28.92,EN,,0,0,0,,That's the one thing I can control
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.72,0:03:28.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,那是我唯一能控制的东西
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.92,0:03:30.36,EN,,0,0,0,,and you know, how I play
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.92,0:03:30.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,至于打成什么样
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.36,0:03:31.64,EN,,0,0,0,,may not always show up how I want
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.36,0:03:31.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,不一定每次都如我所愿
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.64,0:03:34.36,EN,,0,0,0,,to, but the I try to bring that dog, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.64,0:03:34.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,但我会拿出那股狠劲
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.36,0:03:37.16,EN,,0,0,0,,So, thank you to all the fans out there
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.36,0:03:37.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,所以谢谢场上所有的球迷
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.16,0:03:38.36,EN,,0,0,0,,for cheering on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.16,0:03:38.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,谢谢你们为我加油
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.36,0:03:40.60,EN,,0,0,0,,And I heard
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.36,0:03:40.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,我还听见
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.60,0:03:43.16,EN,,0,0,0,,a couple couple dads out there
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.60,0:03:43.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,有那么两位爸爸的嗓门
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.16,0:03:44.36,EN,,0,0,0,,that sounded like mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.16,0:03:44.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,听着特别像我爸
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.36,0:03:45.24,EN,,0,0,0,,So, I appreciate it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.36,0:03:45.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,真的谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.24,0:03:46.44,EN,,0,0,0,,One here and I think there was one
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.24,0:03:46.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,一位在这边 我想那个角落
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.44,0:03:47.40,EN,,0,0,0,,in that corner, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.44,0:03:47.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,好像还有一位
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.40,0:03:49.40,EN,,0,0,0,,So, I appreciate you guys for filling
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.40,0:03:49.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,谢谢你们今天
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.40,0:03:50.60,EN,,0,0,0,,in today.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.40,0:03:50.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,替他补上了这个位置
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.60,0:03:53.24,EN,,0,0,0,,Well, last thing before we let you go,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.60,0:03:53.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,最后一件事 我们就放你走
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.24,0:03:56.36,EN,,0,0,0,,Coco, again, this place loves you
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.24,0:03:56.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,高芙 这个地方爱你
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.36,0:03:57.32,EN,,0,0,0,,and would love the chance
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.36,0:03:57.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,也想借这个机会
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.32,0:03:59.88,EN,,0,0,0,,to let you know just how much the little girl
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.32,0:03:59.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,让你知道 你心里那个
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.88,0:04:01.00,EN,,0,0,0,,in you that's always dreamed
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.88,0:04:01.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,一直梦想着站上
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.00,0:04:02.84,EN,,0,0,0,,of playing on these big stages,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.00,0:04:02.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,这种大舞台的小女孩
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.84,0:04:04.20,EN,,0,0,0,,let her know how much you love her.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.84,0:04:04.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,告诉她你有多爱她
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.20,0:04:06.42,EN,,0,0,0,,That is Coco Gauff.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.20,0:04:06.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,这就是高芙
